3.1.\n\n- **Why v2.3.0:** It is the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy production release. v2.3.1-rc was only deployed to staging, where it was also unhealthy.\n- **Incident:** I opened SEV2 incident INC-0001 for checkout-api. It describes the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, and the next steps. The on-call engineer was paged.\n- **Follow-up:** v2.3.1 needs investigation before it is redeployed. Redeploying it would be a version that has not been healthy in production, which needs change-manager approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}